  "text": "UI Review must show PREDICTED pictures - what a build will probably look like - BEFORE it's built, so he can approve the look before an agent spends money. Assigned agent: **Snap Sully** (book on his card; he's also on ui-review-shots - run after it or build on its storage fix; if the all-rounder router is on main and he's busy, whoever is free - record who). Register in Urgent (id `ui-review-predicted`) + banner entry. Mark the predicted-shots part of pending item `batch-manager` as moved here (pending_change note).",
  "verbatim": false,
